palette.h (colors) and the MARIA behavior modelled in atari7800.c (line RAM
cell format, display list parsing, DMA cycle costs, DLI timing, cart type
decoding) follow MAME's src/mame/atari/maria.cpp, a7800.cpp and
src/devices/bus/a7800/, which are under the BSD-3-Clause license.
No MAME code was copied; palette.h holds MAME's color values.

